function generatePassword() {
    var length = 8,
        charset = "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789!@#$%^&*()",
        retVal = "";
    for (var i=0; i<length; i++) {
        retVal += charset.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * charset.length));
    }
    document.getElementById("password").value = retVal;
}
```

This script will generate a password of length 8 with a combination of lowercase letters, uppercase letters, numbers, and special characters. When a user clicks on the "Generate Password" button, the 'generatePassword' function is triggered and sets generated password to the password input field. 

