PLEASE NOTE THAT 2D ARRAY INDICES IN JAVA START FROM 0, SO THE COORDINATES [1,1] REFER TO THE SECOND ROW AND THE SECOND COLUMN. FOR ARRAY [[1,2],[3,4],[5,6]], THE OUTPUT WILL THEREFORE BE

